  "notes": "・{飛|と}び{跳|は}ねる → {飛|と}び{跳|は}ねない (negative)\n・{飛|と}び{跳|は}ねる → {飛|と}び{跳|は}ねて (te-form)\n・{飛|と}び{跳|は}ねる → {飛|と}び{跳|は}ねた (past)\n\nFORMATION:\nCompound verb: {飛|と}ぶ (to jump/fly) + {跳|は}ねる (to leap/splash)\n\nThe combination emphasizes lively, repeated jumping movements.\n\nCOLLOCATIONS:\n・{嬉|うれ}しくて{飛|と}び{跳|は}ねる - to jump for joy\n・ピョンピョン{飛|と}び{跳|は}ねる - to hop around\n・{元気|げんき}に{飛|と}び{跳|は}ねる - to bounce around energetically\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{跳|は}ねる - to jump; to splash (single movement)\n・ぴょんぴょん{跳|と}ぶ - to hop (onomatopoeic)",
